<title>UK: UK 150 mln stg I/L gilt due 2024 exhausted.</title>
<headline>UK 150 mln stg I/L gilt due 2024 exhausted.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said a 150 million stg tap offer of 2.5 percent index-linked gilts due 2024 was exhausted and no longer operating as a tranchette after the bonds were supplied finally at 128-20.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
</text>
